{
  "info": {
    "name": "LAVO — Auth API",
    "description": "Collection de tests pour le module d'authentification LAVO.\n\nVariable d'environnement requise : `base_url` (ex: http://localhost:3000)\n\n## Flux de test recommandé\n1. Register → status pending_verification, deux cookies\n2. Verify Email → status passe à active\n3. Login → access_token (15 min) + refresh_token\n4. Me → profil via access_token\n5. Refresh → rotation des tokens\n6. Forgot Password → email de réinitialisation\n7. Reset Password → nouveau mot de passe\n8. Logout → révocation DB + suppression cookies",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Register",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register — succès",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Body contient data.id', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.not.have.property('password_hash');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('pending_verification');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.role).to.eql('client');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Cookie access_token présent (15 min)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.cookies.has('access_token')).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Cookie refresh_token présent', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.cookies.has('refresh_token')).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"Jean\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Dupont\",\n  \"email\": \"jean.dupont@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"0612345678\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@1234\",\n  \"remember_me\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register — remember_me 30 jours",
